{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":855329,"ns":0,"title":"Turn (angle)","extract":"The turn (symbol tr or pla) is a unit of plane angle measurement that is the measure of a complete angle—the angle subtended by a complete circle at its center. One turn is equal to 2π radians, 360 degrees or 400 gradians.","description":"Unit of plane angle where a full circle equals 1","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}